{"sections":[{"slug":"Giraud公理","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Giraud公理"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Giraud <span lang=\"zh\">公理</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Giraud 公理"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">据</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/SGA4","text":"SGA 4"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">记载</span>, Grothendieck <span lang=\"zh\">的学生</span> Giraud <span lang=\"zh\">惊人地给出了</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/意象","text":"Grothendieck <span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的纯范畴论刻画</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">后来称为</span> <strong>Giraud <span lang=\"zh\">公理</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">这说明意象还具有一种独立于几何对象的观点</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">陈述</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">称</span> $\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span> <strong>Giraud <span lang=\"zh\">公理</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是说如下条件成立</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/可表现范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">可表现范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":";</li>\n<li>$\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拉回","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拉回</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">保持</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/余极限","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">余极限</span>"}},{"Plain":";</li>\n<li>$\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/和(范畴论)","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">和</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">无交</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $X + Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">的子对象</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">与</span> $Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">的交为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/始对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">始对象</span>"}},{"Plain":" $0$);</li>\n<li>$\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/群胚对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">群胚对象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">均有效</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即等价于商映射的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Čech脉","text":"Čech <span lang=\"zh\">脉</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}}]}